### GET - ver contagem de comandos no banco (H2 Console)
# Acesse: http://localhost:8082/h2-console
# JDBC URL: jdbc:h2:mem:mining-service
# User: sa | Password: (vazio)

### POST - enviar comando LEFT
POST http://localhost:8080/command
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "command": "LEFT"
}

### POST - enviar comando RIGHT
POST http://localhost:8080/command
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "command": "RIGHT"
}

